ish letters.","problemLink":"https://leetcode.com/problems/minimum-operations-to-make-a-rotated-palindrome-i/","problemName":"Minimum Operations to Make a Rotated Palindrome I","problemNumber":4021,"problemSlug":"minimum-operations-to-make-a-rotated-palindrome-i","schemaVersion":2,"sequenceIndex":4021,"solutionApproaches":[]},{"assets":[],"categories":["Math","String"],"constraintBlocks":[],"contentBlocks":[{"sequence":0,"text":"You are given an integer `k`.\n\nAn **infinite** string is formed by **concatenating** the **decimal** representations of the **positive** integers, without separators.\n\nFor every nonnegative integer `b`, block `b` contains the **positive** integers from `10 * b` through `10 * b + 9`. The integers in each block are appended as follows:\n\n- If `b` is even, append the integers in **increasing** order.\n\n- If `b` is odd, append the integers in **decreasing** order.\n\nTherefore, the string starts with the integers 1 through 9, followed by 19 through 10, then 20 through 29, then 39 through 30, and so on.\n\nReturn the `k^(th)` digit (1-indexed) of this string.\n\n**Example 1:**\n\n**Input:** k = 4\n\n**Output:** 4\n\n**Explanation:**\n\nThe string begins as `\"123456789..\"`. The 4^(th) digit is `'4'`.\n\n**Example 2:**\n\n**Input:** k = 15\n\n**Output:** 7\n\n**Explanation:**\n\nThe string begins as `\"123456789191817..\"`. The 15^(th) digit is `'7'`.\n\n**Example 3:**\n\n**Input:** k = 11\n\n**Output:** 9\n\n**Explanation:**\n\nThe string begins as `\"12345678919..\"`. The 11^(th) digit is `'9'`.\n\n**Constraints:**\n\n- `1 <= k <= 10¹⁵`","type":"text"}],"contentHtml":"","contentHtmlLocal":"","databaseEntry":{"categories":["Math","String"],"createdAt":0,"difficulty":"Medium","lastRevisionAt":0,"problem":"You are given an integer `k`.\n\nAn **infinite** string is formed by **concatenating** the **decimal** representations of the **positive** integers, without separators.\n\nFor every nonnegative integer `b`, block `b` contains the **positiv